{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sequel to Benefitship, the story of Amy and Chloe continues as an old friend of Amy's comes back into her life, sparking plenty of sexual tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990010/extras/535eabeeec39a30ea9724801c6725703.webp?t=1771868171\" width=780 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990010/extras/a7f74b8f25eb56d74ec603670618c8fa.avif?t=1771868171\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a hot body and a fun, teasing personality, Erica has spent many late nights with guys and girls alike.\u00a0Having invited her old friend Amy to a Halloween party, she's looking forward to meeting both her... and her new roommate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990010/extras/40d312693c949ca47bb1580aa147735b.avif?t=1771868171\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill, extroverted, and<i>\u00a0slightly</i>\u00a0tomboyish, Amy is Chloe's bubbly and fun roommate. She's up for almost anything, and that statement has never rung more true since moving in with Chloe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced by Baku Satsu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990010/extras/7c9805d32969627ca116fd8dc9fd1181.avif?t=1771868171\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extremely shy introvert with an insatiable love of sex. As a futanari, she's lucky enough to be rooming with Amy, with whom she's started a<i> very</i>\u00a0intimate friendship. With plenty of benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced by Gina Galore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990010/extras/da9a44e9f26f7f6cd5f2f6ff0d8e0af5.webp?t=1771868171\" width=780 height=48 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality futa x female content, illustrated by Sulcate in full HD, 1080p.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~20.000 words of cute and wholesome fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice acting and narration. (Optional)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NSFW &amp; SFW sound effects. (Optional)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+\u00a0<i>unique</i> CG illustrations (not including alts).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of sexy outfits and emotive expressions for all characters.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990010?t=1771868171","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990010?t=1771868171","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990010/51db06c6d0a78f75df70b7c8f7a1a92a070ce38b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771868171","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990010/51db06c6d0a78f75df70b7c8f7a1a92a070ce38b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771868171","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options",